<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background-color: #dc3545; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
    .content { padding: 20px; background-color: #f8f9fa; }
    .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
    .alert-box { background-color: #fff3cd; border: 1px solid #ffc107; padding: 15px; margin: 15px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>⚠️ Plant Alert</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Sudden Environmental Change Detected!</h2>
      <div class="alert-box">
        <p><strong>Device:</strong> {{deviceName}}</p>
        <p><strong>Change Type:</strong> {{changeType}}</p>
        <p><strong>Magnitude:</strong> {{magnitude}}</p>
        <p><strong>Time:</strong> {{timestamp}}</p>
      </div>
      <p>Your plant may need immediate attention. Please check the conditions as soon as possible.</p>
      <p><a href="{{appUrl}}" style="background-color: #28a745; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px;">View Dashboard</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Plant Monitoring System - Keeping your plants healthy</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>